                    <div class="custom-post-template-body default-blog-post-body col-8">
                        
                        <span id="hs_cos_wrapper_post_body" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_meta_field hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="meta_field" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><p>At Free Range, we are thrilled to celebrate the remarkable accomplishments of CodePath as they earn a prestigious <strong>Silver Anthem Award for Best Use of Technology</strong><span style="font-weight: bold;"> in the Education, Art &amp; Culture category</span>. This honor highlights their groundbreaking work in advancing diversity and access in tech education, along with the innovative solutions that have set a new industry standard.</p>
<!--more--><h3>What Are the Anthem Awards?</h3>
<p>The Anthem Awards celebrate impactful innovation, honoring those who challenge the status quo and drive progress in education, art, and culture. The awards spotlight organizations making a tangible difference worldwide with categories dedicated to new technologies and groundbreaking methods.&nbsp;</p>
<p>This year, CodePath, with critical support from <strong>Free Range</strong>, has earned recognition for its remarkable work in reprogramming higher education. Free Range played a pivotal role in this achievement by rebranding CodePath’s website and designing an innovative Application Portal that streamlined their course application process, reduced administrative burdens, and empowered students to access opportunities more efficiently.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Together, we achieved the <a href="https://www.anthemawards.com/winners/list/entry/#education-art-culture/product-innovation-or-service-categories/codepaths-one-stop-application-portal-enables-scale/534748" rel="noopener"><strong>Silver Award for Best Use of Technology in the Education, Art &amp; Culture category</strong></a>, demonstrating the power of strategic design and collaboration to drive meaningful impact.</p>
<h3>What Does CodePath Do?</h3>
<p>CodePath aims to reshape higher education and foster the most diverse generation of engineers, CTOs, and founders. By delivering industry-vetted courses and career support, they create equitable tech opportunities.</p>
<p>With a bold goal of serving over 100,000 students by 2029, CodePath empowers future leaders by streamlining access to high-quality education and career resources. Their innovative Application Portal is at the heart of this impact.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif; color: #000000;"><img src="/hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.9009ab42.png" width="2796" height="1028" loading="lazy" alt="Screenshot 2025-01-20 at 8.56.55 AM" style="height: auto; max-width: 100%; width: 2796px;" srcset="/hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.0d9cbf9f.png 1398w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.9009ab42.png 2796w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.9027bd01.png 4194w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.4a3cc742.png 5592w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.a68c3e17.png 6990w, /hs-fs/hubfs/Screenshot-2025-01-20-at-8.56.55-AM.c218cbb6.png 8388w" sizes="(max-width: 2796px) 100vw, 2796px"></span></p>
<h3>How Free Range Helped Reimagine CodePath's Website</h3>
<p>To support CodePath's ambitious mission, <strong>Free Range</strong> partnered with them to design a new, efficient, and impactful website experience. Our team’s rebranding efforts not only elevated the website’s look and feel but also transformed the user journey, enabling CodePath to serve its community of students better.</p>
<h4>The Application Portal: A Game-Changer</h4>
<p>CodePath’s new Application Portal, created in collaboration with Friday, integrates cutting-edge technology to streamline the application process. Key innovations include:</p>
<ul>
<li aria-level="1"><strong>Multi-Course Applications:</strong> Students can apply to multiple courses without re-entering information.</li>
<li aria-level="1"><strong>Automated Eligibility Checks:</strong> The system ensures students only apply for courses they qualify for, saving time and reducing errors.</li>
<li aria-level="1"><strong>Enhanced Visibility:</strong> Clear application steps and task tracking improve transparency and user experience.</li>
</ul>
<h4>The Results Speak for Themselves</h4>
<p>In the semester since Codepath launched the portal, the organization has seen a <a href="https://www.anthemawards.com/winners/list/entry/#education-art-culture/product-innovation-or-service-categories/codepaths-one-stop-application-portal-enables-scale/534748"><strong><span>124% increase in completed applications</span></strong></a>.</p>
<p>These impressive results helped secure CodePath’s well-deserved recognition at the Anthem Awards and showcase how innovative branding and technology can drive real-world impact.</p>
<h3>Transform Your Brand's Mission</h3>
<p>The success of CodePath’s rebranding and technology integration highlights the power of thoughtful design and innovative tools in achieving organizational goals.</p>
<p><strong>Is your brand ready to make a similar leap?</strong> Free Range specializes in helping mission-driven organizations amplify their impact. From rebranding to designing cutting-edge digital solutions, we can help you reach new heights.</p>
<h4>Book a Free Consultation Today!</h4>
<p>Let’s explore how we can partner to bring your mission to life. <a href="/meetings/paulhammond/availabilities" rel="noopener">Schedule a free 30-minute consultation </a>with our team, and let’s start building your success story.</p></span>
                        
